Subject: [PATCH 3/5] =?UTF-8?q?feat(desktop):=20share-code=20v4=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20carry=20provider=20memory=20sources,=20decode=20leg?=
 =?UTF-8?q?acy=20v3?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Addresses review: the share codec previously mapped unknown sources to
index 0 and decoded them as ordinary 'memory'. Now:

- loadout.ts: optional legacyReaders map — a decoder for an older version
  is selected by the version byte instead of hard-rejecting
- share-code.ts: VERSION=4. The 2-bit source slot gains 'other'; provider
  names are interned in the existing string dict and written as a varint
  back-reference only when source='other' (zero cost for classic graphs)
- v3 codes decode via the registered legacy reader (fixture test); v4
  round-trips provider sources losslessly
---
 .../src/app/starmap/share-code.test.ts        |  30 ++++-
 apps/desktop/src/app/starmap/share-code.ts    | 115 +++++++++++-------
 apps/desktop/src/lib/loadout.ts               |  10 +-
 3 files changed, 110 insertions(+), 45 deletions(-)

diff --git a/apps/desktop/src/app/starmap/share-code.test.ts b/apps/desktop/src/app/starmap/share-code.test.ts
index 6cf33f869f..d53d2a5db7 100644
